{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34442","headline":"和袭美寄题镜岩周尊师所居 · 陆龟蒙","name":"和袭美寄题镜岩周尊师所居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"见说身轻鹤不如，石房无侣共云居。\n清晨自削灵香柹，独夜空吟碧落书。\n十洞飞精应徧吸，一簪秋髪未曾梳。\n知君便入悬珠会，早晚东骑白鲤鱼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34442.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34442","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}